<section class="py-24 bg-[#0d2137]">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
<span class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">Everything You Need</span>
<h2 class="text-4xl font-black mt-4 mb-6 text-white">Complete Cold Therapy System</h2>
<p class="text-gray-400 text-lg">One purchase. Zero trips to the store for ice. Professional-grade recovery in your own backyard.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
