<p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Powerful enough to cool 148 gallons to 42°F and maintain it indefinitely. Built for 24/7 continuous operation.</p>
<div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-cyan-400 font-medium"><span>Cool to 42°F</span><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></div>
</div>
<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d2137,#0a1628);transition:all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-8px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'">
