<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white">No Ice Needed</h3>
<p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">The chiller replaces 100% of your ice. Set your temperature once, and the system maintains it automatically.</p>
<div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-cyan-400 font-medium"><span>Save $100+/month</span><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></div>
</div>
<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d2137,#0a1628);transition:all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-8px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'">
<div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
<svg class="w-7 h-7 text-cyan-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 15a4 4 0 004 4h9a5 5 0 10-.1-9.999 5.002 5.002 0 10-9.78 2.096A4.001 4.001 0 003 15z"/></svg>
</div>
<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white">Whisper Quiet (~40dB)</h3>
<p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Same noise level as a refrigerator. Run it overnight in your garage without disturbing your sleep.</p>
<div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-cyan-400 font-medium"><span>Sleep-friendly</span><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></div>
